content.text:
Pushed (`9dc3f66`). Here's what changed:

---

**Before:** Button showed a tiny SVG icon next to "..." text — looked broken and unprofessional.

**After:** A clean white rotating ring spinner, centered inside the button. Label text hides during loading, reappears when done. Button is disabled while loading to prevent double-clicks.

**The CSS pattern used:**
```css
/* White arc ring on the button's primary color background */
.zcc-spinner {
  width: 18px; height: 18px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 2.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);  /* faint full ring */
  border-top-color: #fff;                      /* bright rotating arc */
  animation: zcc-spin 0.7s linear infinite;
}
```

Run `npx shopify app deploy` to push the updated extension to Shopify so it takes effect on the storefront.

